<head><title>Xin Zhou, PhD | Yale School of Medicine</title></head>
<body>
<h1>Xin Zhou, PhD</h1>
<p>Position: Associate Research Scientist, Section of Infectious Diseases, Department of Internal Medicine, Yale School of Medicine.</p>
<p>Biography: Dr. Xin Zhou is a junior faculty member in the Yale School of Medicine AIDS Program. He received his Ph.D. in Communication from SUNY at Albany. His research investigates the intersection of health communication, communication technology, user engagement with mHealth technologies, and health behavior change.</p>
